From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] wifi/Bluetooth: add BCM4355 Wi-Fi and Bluetooth for
 J71t
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

brcmfmac PCIe support for the J71t BCM4355 C0 (Apple board fallback
names, calibration from the device tree), and Bluetooth over the
Samsung UART with serdev: patchram loading and the J71t device
address.

From the release 2 kernel of the iPad 5 port
(https://github.com/brkosebay/omarchy-ipad5), filtered for OrchardLinux.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
